      <Event name="onChange" paragraph="TXT8--ONCHANGE"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TEMP-TEXT                           PIC    X(100).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF    FUNCTION TRIM(txt8::Text) NOT ALike "ID: %*"
               MOVE    FUNCTION CONCATENATE("ID: ", txt8::Text)
                                                 TO    WS-TEMP-TEXT

               MOVE    WS-TEMP-TEXT              TO    txt8::Text
           END-IF.

           *> UPDATE-CONCATENATION: no paragraph, user procedure or src/ program named
           *> UPDATE-CONCATENATION exists in this project, so what it does cannot be stated. This
           *> handler is kept in <deleted-controls> as the record of a deleted control and is not
           *> generated.
           *> Uses:   Nothing is passed. Just above, the handler of the deleted control txt8 added
           *>         the prefix "ID: " to txt8::Text when it did not match the pattern "ID: %*"
           *>         (through WS-TEMP-TEXT).
           *> Result: Not known: there is no definition to read.

           CALL    "UPDATE-CONCATENATION".
           CONTINUE.
]]></Event>
