      <Event name="onChange" paragraph="TXT13--ONCHANGE"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TEMP                                PIC    X(255).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           *> Verifica se o texto não está vazio e se já não começa com "ID: " para evitar loop

           IF    txt13::Text NOT = SPACES
               IF    FUNCTION TRIM(txt13::Text) NOT = "ID: "
                   SET     WS-TEMP               TO    SPACES
                   STRING    "ID: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                   txt13::Text DELIMITED BY SIZE
                       INTO WS-TEMP
                   SET     txt13::Text           TO    WS-TEMP
               END-IF
           END-IF
           PERFORM    UPDATE-CONCATENATION
           CONTINUE.
]]></Event>
    </DeletedControl>
